B.XK=new A.bW("tip_1","Keep a 3-second distance","Spot a landmark passed by the car ahead. You should reach it no sooner than counting one-two-three.","timer","assets/images/tips/tip_1.webp")
B.Xy=new A.bW("tip_2","Do not brake in deep puddles","If the car starts hydroplaning, do not turn the wheel and smoothly release throttle until grip is restored.","water","assets/images/tips/tip_2.webp")
B.Y1=new A.bW("tip_3","Adjust mirrors with no blind spots","Side mirrors should show only the edge of your car rear wing, with the rest showing the road.","visibility","assets/images/tips/tip_3.webp")
B.Y_=new A.bW("tip_4","Enter roundabout with right turn signal","When entering a roundabout, turn on only the right indicator, not the left.","roundabout","assets/images/tips/tip_4.webp")
B.XG=new A.bW("tip_5","In FWD skid \u2014 gently accelerate","If the rear axle starts sliding, smoothly add throttle and steer into the skid. Do not hit the brakes!","car_drive","assets/images/tips/tip_5.webp")
B.XW=new A.bW("tip_6","In RWD skid \u2014 release accelerator","In a rear-wheel drive skid, immediately release the accelerator and gently correct trajectory with the wheel.","car_skid","assets/images/tips/tip_6.webp")
B.Yo=new A.bW("tip_7","Stop strictly before the STOP sign",'Sign 6.16 "Stop line" and marking define the boundary. Crossing with the bumper is recorded as running a red light.',"stop_sign","assets/images/tips/tip_7.webp")
B.XB=new A.bW("tip_8","Do not tailgate a truck before passing","Stay 25\u201330 meters behind the truck to have a clear advance view of the oncoming lane.","truck","assets/images/tips/tip_8.webp")
B.Y5=new A.bW("tip_9","On a slope, descending traffic yields","On steep slopes with signs 1.13 and 1.14, the vehicle moving uphill has priority.","slope","assets/images/tips/tip_9.webp")
B.Ya=new A.bW("tip_10","Green light does not guarantee safety","Proceeding on green, ensure all vehicles from the cross street have cleared the intersection.","traffic_light","assets/images/tips/tip_10.webp")
B.Yc=new A.bW("tip_11","Engine-brake on slippery roads","Downshift early. This prevents wheel lockup and car skidding.","ice","assets/images/tips/tip_11.webp")
B.Xu=new A.bW("tip_12","Do not turn wheels while waiting to turn left","Waiting for a gap in oncoming traffic, keep wheels straight. A rear-end hit will not push you into oncoming cars.","turn_left","assets/images/tips/tip_12.webp")
B.Yg=new A.bW("tip_13","Cannot see truck mirrors? Driver cannot see you","Large trucks have huge blind spots on the right and directly under the cab. Do not linger beside them.","blind_spot","assets/images/tips/tip_13.webp")
B.XO=new A.bW("tip_14","Adjacent lane slows down \u2014 you brake too","If a car in the neighboring lane slows down before a crosswalk, someone is likely crossing.","pedestrian","assets/images/tips/tip_14.webp")
B.Xx=new A.bW("tip_15","Truck swings left before a right turn","Long trucks need clearance for trailer off-tracking. Never try to squeeze into the open pocket on the right.","turn_right","assets/images/tips/tip_15.webp")
B.Yh=new A.bW("tip_16","Turn on AC when windows fog up","Air conditioning quickly dehumidifies cabin air. Direct airflow to windshield and turn off recirculation.","wind","assets/images/tips/tip_16.webp")
B.Yq=new A.bW("tip_17","On a slope, turn wheels into the curb","Parking downhill, turn wheels right (into curb); uphill with curb, turn wheels left.","parking_icon","assets/images/tips/tip_17.webp")
B.XE=new A.bW("tip_18","Use low beams and fog lights in fog","High beams create a blinding white wall of water droplets. Reduce speed and keep your distance.","fog","assets/images/tips/tip_18.webp")
B.XN=new A.bW("tip_19","Hazard triangle: 15 m in city, 30 m on highway","Place the sign well in advance so other drivers have time to change lanes safely.","hazard_triangle","assets/images/tips/tip_19.webp")
B.Ym=new A.bW("tip_20","Take a 15-minute break every 2\u20133 hours","Heavy eyelids and frequent yawning signal microsleep. Pull over, drink water, and do light stretching.","rest","")
